==History==
2024
*The Wizard's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 6/5/2024, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/5/2024)|May 2024 Update]].
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Wizard's shield hitpoints by 18%.
*On 2/7/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/7/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Wizard's shield hitpoints by 20.2%.
*On 6/8/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/8/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Wizard's shield hitpoints by 35.8%, but increased the Evolved Wizard's hitpoints by 4.8%.
*On 8/10/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/10/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Wizard's shield death pushback to 3 tiles (from 4 tiles).
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], added a sound effect to the Evolved Wizard after death.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Evolved Wizard's hitpoints by 0.13%, his shield hitpoints by 1.05%, and decreased his shield death damage by 0.43%.
*On 3/6/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/6/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Wizard's shield death damage by 22%.

