==Trivia==
*The word "''Wizard''" comes from the Middle English "''wys''", meaning wise.
**In the German, Persian, and Vietnamese language settings of the game, the Wizard's name translates to "Magician". In the Chinese language settings of the game, the Wizard's name translates to "Mage". In the Italian language settings of the game, the Wizard's name translates to "Sorcerer".
*The Wizard’s Evolution somewhat resembles the [[w:c:clashofclans:Super Wizard|Super Wizard]] from Clash of Clans.
*When deployed, the Evolved Wizard exclaims "''Evo Wizard!''", and occasionally when attacking, he will say “''Magic!''”, “''Fire!''”, “''Fireball!''”, or "''Evo Wizard!''", referencing the Clash of Clans [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6BsTLlR40kM Magic commercial].
**There is a [[Loading Screen Hints|Loading Screen Hint]] that says “''The Wizard can control all elements, except his hair''”. This is also a reference to the same commercial.
**The Wizard is 1 of 9 evolved troops that speak distinct words when on the field, the others being [[Bomber/Evolution|Bomber]], [[Goblin Cage/Evolution|Goblin Brawler]], [[Witch/Evolution|Witch]], [[P.E.K.K.A./Evolution|P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Hunter/Evolution|Hunter]], [[Executioner/Evolution|Executioner]], [[Mega Knight/Evolution|Mega Knight]], and [[Lumberjack/Evolution|Lumberjack]].
*The Evolved Wizard, [[Ice Wizard]], and [[Electro Wizard]] are responsible for creating the [[Void]], according to the Clash Royale [https://youtube.com/shorts/32qX1fEbxX4?si=KqXAuxOvVZ5QaMFP Void intro video].
*The Evolved Wizard is featured on the [[Cards|card]] render of the Void.
*The Wizard’s Evolution is the subject of 4 [[Emotes]].
*Before the Wizard's Evolution's release, the Evolved Wizard's shield hitpoints were decreased by 15%.
